-- vw_individuals: Every individual of the world (owl:Thing). What is said about one individual alone is a column of its row: its age, the place it attends, whether it is asserted to be a Person or a School. Its current grade level and role come from their records. Class membership is a formula, not a table, because it is concluded: no one stated that South Park Elementary is a School.
-- Combines base table columns with calculated/lookup/aggregation fields.
